# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says. Several gates read bytes, not lines:
# site-facts counts a file's bytes, parity's corpus mutates line endings, and zayn embeds pages it serves. A Windows clone with
# autocrlf=true wrote CRLF and failed three of them (found by Central, 2026-11-06), so the checkout is held to LF here.
* text=auto eol=lf

# files that are bytes, never text
*.wasm binary
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
